1562 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 450 0 R
/E (Observations: The recursive implementation shows classic exponential growth: 0.053s at n=30 jumps to 6.70s at n=40 - a 126x increase for just 10 more values. Iterative and DP sit effectively flat near zero on the chart \(under 0.00001s\) even at n=40, demonstrating the transformative power of eliminating redundant computation. The gap between recursive and iterative at n=40 is over 3 million times.)
/Pg 45 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
