1565 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 451 0 R
/E (Observations: Recursive Fibonacci shows near-zero measured memory because tracemalloc only tracks heap allocations, not CPython call stack frames. DP uses slightly more memory \(1.63KB at n=40\) due to the memo dictionary, which is the expected O\(n\) overhead. Iterative uses effectively zero memory \(O\(1\)\), confirming it as the most space-efficient approach.)
/Pg 46 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
