/Title (Bubble Sort at n=10000 already takes 5.56 seconds; scaling to n=100000 would take approximately 556 seconds \(9+ minutes\). Merge Sort at the same size takes 0.02 seconds - it could handle n=1000000 in roughly 0.3 seconds. For Fibonacci, recursive computation becomes impractical beyond n=40 \(6.7s\), while iterative computes n=1000000 in under a second.)
